\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}^{2}-27 & =5 \\\\ 2{x}^{2} & =32 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =16\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we take the square root of both sides of the equation and solve the resulting absolute value equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{16} \\\\ |x| & =4 \\\\ x & =\\pm 4\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068476 :question/id #uuid "6145c2d5-5d09-543c-8405-1319277323aa" :question/math-academy-id "e-13968" :question/problem "Solve for $p$ where $4p^2 - 11 = 14.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we isolate the $p^2$ on one side of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{p}^{2}-11 & =14 \\\\ 4{p}^{2} & =25 \\\\ {p}^{2} & =\\frac{25}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we take the square root of both sides of the equation and solve the resulting absolute value equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{{p}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{4}} \\\\ |p| & =\\frac{\\sqrt{25}}{\\sqrt{4}} \\\\ |p| & =\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ p & =\\pm \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068477 :question/id #uuid "9c00e3e1-9337-5380-af51-e7e8c7ae9f48" :question/math-academy-id "e-13970" :question/problem "Find $t$ if $2t^2 = 36.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we isolate the $t^2$ on one side of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\t\t2t^2 &= 36\\\\\n\t\tt^2 &= 18\n\t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we take the square root of both sides of the equation and solve the resulting absolute value equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\t\t\n\t\t\\sqrt{t^2} &= \\sqrt{18} \\\\\n\t\t\\vert t \\vert &= \\sqrt{18} \\\\\n\t\t\\vert t \\vert &= \\sqrt{9 \\cdot 2} \\\\\n\t\t\\vert t \\vert &= \\sqrt{9} \\cdot \\sqrt{2} \\\\\n\t\t\\vert t \\vert &= 3\\sqrt{2} \\\\\n\t\tt &= \\pm 3\\sqrt{2}\n\t\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069036 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a4dd284e-c46b-5c23-bb9a-743fbf031924" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "± 3\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065650}